% Generate pdd/frontend/index.tsx as the React entrypoint.

Import React, ReactDOM/client, styles.css, App, CloudDashboard, and ToastProvider.
Require document.getElementById('root'); throw when absent.
Render inside StrictMode and ToastProvider.
Paths starting /cloud or /connect/ mount CloudDashboard.
All other paths mount App. Keep only bootstrap logic in this file.
